# Track only the custom theme
*

# Keep git metadata files
!.gitignore
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/**

# Allow path down to theme
!app/
!app/public/
!app/public/wp-content/
!app/public/wp-content/themes/
!app/public/wp-content/themes/mandevco/
!app/public/wp-content/themes/mandevco/**
